# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OnlineCompiler.io REST API key for in-app Java execution (OpenJDK 25).
#
# This is a *REST API* key — create it on the "API Keys" page of your
# OnlineCompiler.io dashboard (NOT a WebSocket/Widget key). It is used ONLY by
# the server-side route handler (src/app/api/run/route.ts); it is never sent to
# the browser.
#
# There is NO NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix on purpose: this value must stay secret. In
# Vercel, add it as a *Secret* environment variable named COMPILE_API_KEY.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
COMPILE_API_KEY=your_rest_api_key_here

# Optional: override the Java compiler identifier if your account exposes it
# under a different id than the default.
# JAVA_COMPILER=openjdk-25
